OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F310A1785190687
OL,3,CCarly Simon reveals she has
OL,4,CParkinson's disease and battled skin
OL,5,Ccancer
OL,7,FSinger Carly Simon has shared her
OL,8,FParkinson's disease diagnosis as she
OL,9,Fprepares to publish her first album in
OL,10,F15 years.
OL,12,FThe You're So Vain hitmaker, 83, said
OL,13,Fher health issues had forced her to
OL,14,Fstep away from the spotlight, causing
OL,15,Fmany fans to ask her about her
OL,16,F"relative silence".
OL,18,F"The truth is, I've been learning how
OL,19,Fto live with Parkinson's disease,"
OL,20,FSimon said in a statement shared on
OL,21,FMonday.
OL,26,@zD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/13
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
