OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F310A1785190687
OL,3,CCarly Simon reveals she has
OL,4,CParkinson's disease and battled skin
OL,5,Ccancer
OL,7,F"It has taken me some time to
OL,8,Funderstand the diagnosis, to adjust to
OL,9,Fit, and to decide how much I wanted to
OL,10,Fsay about it publicly."
OL,12,FParkinson's disease is a
OL,13,Fneurodegenerative condition in which
OL,14,Fparts of the brain become
OL,15,Fprogressively damaged over the years,
OL,16,Fcausing symptoms such as involuntary
OL,17,Fshaking, stiff and inflexible muscles
OL,18,Fand slow movement.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/13
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
