PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F310A1785190687
OL,3,CCarly Simon reveals she has
OL,4,CParkinson's disease and battled skin
OL,5,Ccancer
OL,7,FSubscribe for free to our weekly
OL,8,Fnewsletter for exclusive and original
OL,9,Fcoverage from ITV News. Direct to your
OL,10,Finbox every Friday morning.
OL,12,FThere is currently no cure for the
OL,13,Fdisease.
OL,15,F"Parkinson's is different for
OL,16,Feveryone, and it can be
OL,17,Funpredictable," Simon said.
OL,26,@wD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/13
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
