OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F310A1785190687
OL,3,CCarly Simon reveals she has
OL,4,CParkinson's disease and battled skin
OL,5,Ccancer
OL,7,F"Some days I'm so tired I can't get
OL,8,Fthe day moving at all. On others, it
OL,9,Fgives me a little more room to move,
OL,10,Fthink, work, and feel like myself."
OL,12,FSimon said she began noticing the
OL,13,Fsymptoms of Parkinson's after having
OL,14,Farthritis in both of her knees and one
OL,15,Fhip, leading her to have all three
OL,16,Fjoints replaced.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/13
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,311,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31005
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F310A1785190687
OL,3,CCarly Simon reveals she has
OL,4,CParkinson's disease and battled skin
OL,5,Ccancer
OL,7,FShe assumed her difficulty walking
OL,8,Fafter surgery was "simply an
OL,9,Funfortunate and rather ironic part of
OL,10,Fthe recovery process", but her
OL,11,Fmobility continued to worsen.
OL,13,F"I had trouble standing up from low
OL,14,Fchairs and deep couches without
OL,15,Fsomeone offering me an arm," Simon
OL,16,Fsaid.
OL,26,@uD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/13
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,311,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31006
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F310A1785190687
OL,3,CCarly Simon reveals she has
OL,4,CParkinson's disease and battled skin
OL,5,Ccancer
OL,7,F"Overstuffed furniture became my
OL,8,Fenemy. Once seated, I could feel as
OL,9,Fthough I had been swallowed by the
OL,10,Fchair and might remain there
OL,11,Fpermanently, like a guest who had
OL,12,Fbadly overstayed her welcome.
OL,14,F"Eventually, there were periods when I
OL,15,Fcould not walk without considerable
OL,16,Fhelp. My family and I knew that
OL,17,Fsomething more was going on.
OL,19,F"After an extensive evaluation at the
OL,20,FMayo Clinic, I was diagnosed with
OL,21,FParkinson's."
OL,26,@vD@AOU{D@AOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/13
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,311,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31007
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F310A1785190687
OL,3,CCarly Simon reveals she has
OL,4,CParkinson's disease and battled skin
OL,5,Ccancer
OL,7,FSimon said she has been undergoing
OL,8,Ftreatment to help with stiffness and
OL,9,Fother symptoms, but said the illness
OL,10,Fdid not have a "tidy or predictable
OL,11,Fschedule".
OL,13,F"It does not consult my calendar
OL,14,Fbefore deciding what kind of day I am
OL,15,Fgoing to have," the singer said.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G7/13
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,311,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31008
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F310A1785190687
OL,3,CCarly Simon reveals she has
OL,4,CParkinson's disease and battled skin
OL,5,Ccancer
OL,7,F"Parkinson's is usually associated
OL,8,Fwith movement, tremors, and balance,
OL,9,Fbut it can affect much more than the
OL,10,Fbody. It can bring anxiety,
OL,11,Fdepression, exhaustion, and apathy.
OL,12,FThe apathy is particularly strange.
OL,14,F"You can find yourself lying there
OL,15,Flike a starfish drying in the sun,
OL,16,Farms pointing in all directions, while
OL,17,Fnothing inside is telling you to get
OL,18,Fup, read, watch, write, sing, call
OL,19,Fsomeone, or do much of anything at all.
OL,26,@vD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G8/13
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,311,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31009
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F310A1785190687
OL,3,CCarly Simon reveals she has
OL,4,CParkinson's disease and battled skin
OL,5,Ccancer
OL,7,F"That has been one of the hardest
OL,8,Fthings to explain. It is not simply
OL,9,Fsadness or laziness. It is as though
OL,10,Fthe part of the brain that sends out
OL,11,Finvitations to participate in life has
OL,12,Ftemporarily misplaced the guest list."
OL,14,FAmid her Parkinson's diagnosis, Simon
OL,15,Frevealed she has also been receiving
OL,16,Ftreatment for basal cell carcinoma,
OL,17,Fthe most common type of skin cancer.
OL,19,FShe had surgery to remove the cancer,
OL,20,Fbut the impact on her appearance made
OL,21,Fher reluctant to be seen in public.
OL,26,@oD@AOUtD@fO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G9/13
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,311,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31010
SC,0010
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F310A1785190687
OL,3,CCarly Simon reveals she has
OL,4,CParkinson's disease and battled skin
OL,5,Ccancer
OL,7,F"I have always been more critical of
OL,8,Fmy appearance than anyone else could
OL,9,Fpossibly imagine (check out the irony
OL,10,Fof having written 'You're So Vain'),
OL,11,Fand this gave my inner critic quite a
OL,12,Flot of new material," Simon said.
OL,14,F"Between my mobility issues, the
OL,15,FParkinson's diagnosis, the surgery,
OL,16,Fand the emotional effects of it all,
OL,17,Fwithdrawing from public view was the
OL,18,Fmost palatable reaction."
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G10/13
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,311,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31011
SC,0011
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F310A1785190687
OL,3,CCarly Simon reveals she has
OL,4,CParkinson's disease and battled skin
OL,5,Ccancer
OL,7,FDespite the difficulties, Simon has
OL,8,Fcontinued to work and her new album
OL,9,Fcalled Comes In Waves is scheduled for
OL,10,Frelease on August 14.
OL,12,FShe said that music had rescued her
OL,13,F"more times than I can count",
OL,14,Fdescribing it as "like a cat or dog
OL,15,Fthat quietly appears beside you when
OL,16,Fit senses you are not quite yourself".
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G11/13
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,311,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31012
SC,0012
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F310A1785190687
OL,3,CCarly Simon reveals she has
OL,4,CParkinson's disease and battled skin
OL,5,Ccancer
OL,7,F"There were melodies, verses, and
OL,8,Fideas written down and tucked away for
OL,9,Fsome unknown future when I would have
OL,10,Fthe time and attention to finish them.
OL,11,FApparently, that future is now," she
OL,12,Fsaid.
OL,14,F"Working on the music gave shape to
OL,15,Fdays that did not always have much
OL,16,Fshape. It gave me somewhere to go
OL,17,Fwithout having to leave the room.
OL,19,F"It reminded me that illness can
OL,20,Fchange your life without becoming the
OL,21,Fwhole of your life."
OL,26,@oD@AOUvD@AOU{D@AOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G12/13
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
