OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F310A1785190687
OL,3,CCarly Simon reveals she has
OL,4,CParkinson's disease and battled skin
OL,5,Ccancer
OL,7,FSimon rose to fame in the 1970s with a
OL,8,Fstring of hit singles including
OL,9,FAnticipation, You Belong To Me and
OL,10,FNobody Does It Better.
OL,12,FShe then achieved global fame with her
OL,13,Fthird album, No Secrets in 1972, which
OL,14,Fcontained the hit song You're So Vain.
OL,16,FThe star is mother to Sally, 52, and
OL,17,FBen, 49, from her marriage to singer
OL,18,FJames Taylor from 1972 to 1983, and
OL,19,FComes In Waves will be her first album
OL,20,Fin almost 15 years.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G13/13
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
